description=Add-on for HARMONIE - Life With Style. The clothes and bags of Tomb's Wardrobe - Alternative become Life With Style fashion pieces (207 pieces, every colour can be picked in the wardrobe): gacha / admin rewards that belong to the player's account, never drop, weigh nothing and protect nothing. Nothing of Tomb's Wardrobe turns up in the world any more: its loot rows and zombie outfits are removed. A real Tomb's Wardrobe item a player carries becomes the matching wardrobe piece (a bag only once it is empty -- nothing inside is lost). Real carrying is vanilla bags, which The Way To Attack can upgrade. Load it AFTER Tomb's Wardrobe - Alternative. Needs Tomb's Player Body and Tomb's Wardrobe - Alternative (Tomb's Player Body - Compatibility recommended). English and Thai.
